CHAPTER.VERS:
Is my heritage to me as a speckled bird of prey? Are the birds of prey against her round about? Go

          {+}
        , assemble

          {+}
         all the beasts of the field, bring

          {+}
         them to devour.

They have sown wheat, and have reaped thorns; they have tired themselves out, and profit nothing. And be

          {+}
         ashamed of your

          {+}
         fruits, because of the fierce anger of Yahweh.
